#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Displays comprehensive information about the user in a result card. You can see: their channels, shared channels, how long they've been online, how long they've been idle, their away message (if set), their bio (if set), whether they're registered with NickServ, and client details (browser, OS, screen resolution, language, and timezone) when available. You can also trigger"
